2026-07-27T07:52:50.1591202Z i /tmp/RtmpgZ9skv/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:52:50.1591667Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:52:50.1592205Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:52:50.1593122Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:52:50.1593885Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:52:50.1594940Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:52:50.1595762Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
